# .github is NOT ignored. A blanket ignore here silently swallowed every
# workflow added after 2025-07-13: impl-issue-status.yml sat on disk
# untracked until #254 committed it, which is why no Impl marker had ever
# moved an issue. The issue and pull-request templates are still held back:
# both change contributor-facing behaviour and deserve their own review.
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
.github/pull_request_template.md

